# LARM CODEOWNERS
#
# This file routes review requests to the appropriate governance
# committee per GOVERNANCE.md. GitHub auto-requests review from any
# matching owner when a PR modifies a file under that pattern.
#
# Ordering matters: the LAST matching pattern wins for any given file.
# Place model-governed and spec-governed paths AFTER the broad code
# defaults so they take precedence.
#
# The three committee teams must exist under the @openlarm GitHub
# organisation for this file to function. Teams used below:
#   @openlarm/code-tsc           — Code TSC (code, architecture, CI)
#   @openlarm/model-governance   — parameter values, gating rules
#   @openlarm/spec-editors       — normative spec wording
# @mkkb2156 is listed alongside each team as the founder fallback
# so review requests still resolve while the teams are small.

# ─── Default: Code TSC owns everything not specifically reassigned ───────────

*                                                                  @openlarm/code-tsc @mkkb2156

